    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Faculty of Arts and Sciences at Aga Khan University (AKU-FAS) recently hosted the Pakistan History Workshop, which brought together historians, scholars, and archivists from both Pakistan and abroad to explore the country's rich and complex history. Organized by Dr Sana Haroon (University of Massachusetts-Boston) and Dr Zoya Sameen (Aga Khan University), the event served as a platform for dialogue, collaboration, and critical examination of historical narratives.",
